    1220 0101 1111 2202 1211 2211 1010 1121 2012 2121
    0002 0022 0212 2002 2011 0020 0220 2120 0012 0102
    2110 0202 2222 1101 2122 1122 2020 2212 1021 1212
                  g 4k+2                               g 4k+3
    0100 1100 2111 0210 2010 1000 1011 1102 2100 0122
    2102 0111 1221 0112 1202 1012 1110 2221 1120 2001
    0200 2200 1222 0120 1020 2000 2022 2201 1200 0211
    1201 0222 2112 0221 2101 2021 2220 1112 2210 1002

Translating these codes into number, color, shape and shading gives 4
disjoint 20-card no-SET’s. The remaining card has code 0000.
